


## to run this project first
0 - check .env files
1 - go inside each folder and bun install
2 - go on the hone and do bun db:push
3 - chmod +x run.sh
4 - run.sh
5 - go to http://localhost:4321


## to format this project
bunx biome format .

## to fix issues and format this project
bunx biome format --write .
